            <p>This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>BagVati</strong> ("Company", "we", "our", "us") collects, uses, shares, and protects your personal data when you visit or use our website <code>https://www.bagvati.works</code> ("Platform"). By accessing or using our Platform, you agree to this Privacy Policy and our Terms & Conditions.</p>

